dotbot

This program reimplements in Rust the memory format, the team file format and the
protocol of DS Bot (https://github.com/Fei2411/DeepSeek-Bot), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0, and follows parts of its prompts and rules. The memory files use the
Markdown format of Agent Memory Repo (https://github.com/AgentMemoryRepo/agentmemoryrepo).

crates/pi-agent-core contains a Rust translation and customization of pi-agent-core
from https://github.com/earendil-works/pi, revision
d5b3de22d0e24a3e9c38a9410d3329b099717283.
